      "body": "Hey User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d  - Just looking at the scope for this card and wanted to ask if the below 3rd parties are/should be loaded via GTM. Can we check with the busienss?\n\n- Einstein Recommendations\n- Crazy Egg heat mapping \n- Optimizely A/B testing\n- Measmerize size widget\n- Narvar EDD widget\n- Emarsys Web Extend",
