  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13665",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 The product card user story is ready for your review - I’ll assign to Emma first. \n\nThe product card behaviour on the ‘see full recently viewed’ page was not specified in the design - I asked Kiera - she recommended to keep the behaviour similar to product card on PLP. I have written the story in that way - if you expect the product card to behave differently on the see full recently viewed page, please let me know the desired behaviour and I’ll update the AC.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
