    {
      "id": "13880",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d Please see my notes below:\n\nCore component:\n\n- We don’t want the product badge to render in all locations. PLP, the Full History of Recently Viewed and in the Wishlist is ok. We do not want the badge displayed on the Homepage or on the Recently Viewed product carousel at the bottom of pages. If we place products on an editorial or landing page we also wouldn’t want the badge applied. \n- Similarly, we don’t want the hover action (model photo( on the homepage or the recently viewed carousel at the bottom of the pages.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Dani Rivett",
        "name": "Dani Rivett",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/42d3d7910c25b8f4ba9e46aabfc6c149?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDR-3.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-14T17:02:13.918+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-14T17:02:13.918+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13891",
      "body": "User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 Thanks for your review.\nI am updating the following AC, change is green, red is removed.\n\\*\\*Core Component\\*\\*\n1. Given a product is passed to the card component, when it renders, then the primary product image is and product name are always displayed regardless of variation.\n1. Given a product has a badge (e.g. Runway), when the card renders in any variation, then the badge is displayed in the correct position per Figma.\n1. Given the card renders, when on desktop and the user hovers, then the tile image switches from the item/flat photo to the model photo.\n\\*\\*PLP Variation\\*\\*\n1. Given the card renders on PLP, when on desktop and the user hovers, then the size selector becomes visible and the price disappears and the tile image switches from the item/flat photo to the model photo.\n\\*\\*Home page variation\\*\\*\n1. Given the card renders on home page, when it is in the default state, then the image, name, and badge are displayed.\n\\*\\*Wishlist variation\\*\\*\n1. Given the card renders on wishlist, when on desktop and the user hovers, then the tile image switches from the item/flat photo to the model photo.\n1. Given the card renders on wishlist, when on desktop and the user hovers, then the arrows appear for the shopper to click through the product images.\n\\*\\*Recently Viewed Full History variation (same behavior as PLP card)\\*\\*\n1. Given the card renders on recently viewed full history page, when on desktop and the user hovers, then the size selector becomes visible and the price disappears and the tile image switches from the item/flat photo to the model photo.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
