  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "# Given a shopper is viewing a PDP on desktop, when the page renders, then the \"Recommended for You\" section is displayed as a 3-column product grid below the product detail.\n# Given a shopper is viewing a PDP on mobile, when the page renders, then the \"Recommended for You\" section is displayed as a 2-column product grid below the product detail.\n# Given a shopper has opened the search overlay and has not yet typed anything, when the overlay renders on desktop, then a \"Recommended for You\" product grid is displayed.\n# Given a shopper has opened the search overlay and has not yet typed anything, when the overlay renders on mobile, then the \"Recommended for You\" product grid is displayed in a 2-column layout.\n# Given a shopper has opened the search overlay on desktop (before or during typing), when the overlay renders, then a \"Recommended for You\" product grid is displayed.\n# Given a shopper has opened the search overlay on mobile (before or during typing), when the overlay renders, then the \"Recommended for You\" product grid is displayed in a 2-column layout.\n# Given a shopper is logged in, when the component renders on any surface, then recommendations are driven by their browsing and purchase history via Einstein Product Recommendations.\n# Given a shopper is not logged in, when the component renders on any surface, then recommendations fall back to session-based browsing history.\n# Given a shopper clicks a recommended product tile, when the action completes, then they are navigated to that product's PDP.\n# Given the \"Recommended for You\" section has been toggled off in Business Manager for the PDP, when a shopper views a product detail page, then it is not displayed.\n# Given Einstein returns no recommendations, when the section would otherwise render, then a rules-based fallback set of products is displayed and no empty state is shown to the shopper.\n# Given the \"Recommended for You\" section renders on any surface, when displayed, then each product tile includes product name, price, and quick-add to bag icon, consistent with the standard PLP tile."
  },
