  "description": "As a Developer, \nI want a reusable `product-card-group` React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \nso that it can render a labelled group of product cards across multiple pages including PDP, PLP, and Homepage.\n\n----\n\nThe component renders an optional section header (title + link) and a responsive row of ProductCard components (SFCC-236). It does not own the product data or navigation logic — it receives a product array, title, and link label as props. Whether the underlying data comes from SFCC merchandising logic, a Contentful-curated editorial slot, or a personalisation engine is irrelevant to the component.\n\n*Props in scope:*\n\n|**Prop**|**Values**|**Notes**|\n|---|---|---|\n|display|3, 4, 6|Controls number of product cards rendered|\n|size|Desktop, Mobile|Controls layout breakpoint|\n|showTitleAndLink|true, false|Toggles the entire section header|\n|showLink|true, false|Independently toggles the link within the header; only applies when showTitleAndLink=true|\n|title|string|Section heading text|\n|linkLabel|string|Link text e.g. Shop All, View More|\n\nExamples of usage: More from this category and Recommended for you on the PDP.",
